            "review_title": "Review at Thanh's Kitchen",
            "review_text": "Mariana\nEdgware, United Kingdom4 contributions\n0\nThe most delicious experience!\nNov 2024 • Couples\nYou haven't tried true Vietnamese food if you do not visit Thanh's Kitchen! After several days in both Hanoi and Saigon, having tried various hand-piked local eateries, we had lunch at Thanh's Kitchen and discovered how delcious Vietnamise food is when prepared masterfully using fresh, high quality ingredients. Only then we understood what the fuss was all about - thank you for a truly scrumptious experience!!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 1, 2024",
